{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And we turned and journeyed toward the wilderness, by the way of the Sea of Reeds, as He spoke.</b> As he proceeds to expound: <b>and we circled Mount Seir — many days.</b> Nineteen years; they are the journeys from Rismah to the wilderness of Zin, which is Kadesh, as he explained in the pericope of Ḥukkat."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:51:19.134438066Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}